	"data": "University of Tokyo — IST (Information Science and Technology)\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research. See also [[projects/mext-scholarship-2029|Mext Scholarship 2029]] for funding details.\n\nOverview\n\nThe University of Tokyo (UTokyo) is Japan's #1 university with the broadest range of CS research. The Graduate School of Information Science and Technology (IST) offers multiple departments relevant to XR/spatial computing, with the Naemura Lab (ICE) being the top…",
